OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,6,Fdeveloping during the day but these
OL,7,Finterspersed with cloudier periods and
OL,8,Fshowers, which may be heavy. Still
OL,9,Fbreezy but winds generally easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly cloudy through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with some clear
OL,13,Fintervals between showers, some of
OL,14,Fwhich will be heavy. Breezy in the
OL,15,Fevening then winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
