OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day with scattered showers in the
OL,7,Fmorning, which may be heavy. Showers
OL,8,Feasing through the afternoon leading
OL,9,Fto largely dry conditions in the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,13,Fdry with sunny spells on Saturday.
OL,14,FCloudy with light rain and strong
OL,15,Fwinds for Outer Hebrides Sunday and
OL,16,FMonday, drier and bright with light
OL,17,Fwinds further east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
